'''Cinderace''' (Japanese: '''エースバーン''' ''Aceburn'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

