==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Cinderace|34}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion. 
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-B}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Cinderace|36}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.
*'''Fireball Shot''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Chilling Reign|Cinderace|28}} from the {{TCG|Chilling Reign}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

